# W4e, a (k5): the gate to stag0101 at @120; the gate form lists k's row; New instance with its Public default 1.5 s later
# (DW4_ONLINE_AUTOCHOICE_DELAY_MS): its barrier comes after b's. b's instance is Private: a plays alone.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a in stag0101
wander -150 -60 20 until frames>=1800 fail present>=2
log a alone
idle until frames>=60
